and upper body, blurred background enhancing intimacy and dreamy atmosphere. Natural ambient daylight filters through leaf canopy creating soft highlights and gentle contrast without harsh shadows. Warm golden hour glow subtly enhances skin tone warmth and fabric textures.\n\n> Visual guidance cues include eye contact from model looking slightly upward toward viewer, inviting smile conveying joyful serenity — perfect candid moment frozen in time. Subtle motion blur suggested around stray strands of loose hair caught in breeze adds dynamic realism.\n\n> Artistic style blends cinematic portrait photography with lifestyle aesthetic reminiscent of Leica rangefinder film shots mixed with Instagrammable travel aesthetics — highly detailed, photorealistic rendering but retains painterly tonal harmony suitable for print media or social content platforms like Pinterest/WeChat Moments/Bilibili Shorts.\n\n---\n\n🎯 **可选附加参数建议（适用于特定平台）**\n\n- *For SDXL/Midjourney:*  \n`--ar 16:9 --v 7 --style photographic --stylize 8"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 89, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#6c6088", "size": [240, 140], "pos": [720, 0], "id": 69, "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 29}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [44], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#3f384f", "widgets_values": ["prefix", "suffix"], "inputs": [{"name": "input", "link": 46, "label": "输入", "type": "*", "localized_name": "input"}, {"widget": {"name": "prefix"}, "shape": 7, "name": "prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "suffix"}, "shape": 7, "name": "suffix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "suffix"}], "f